{"summary":"Relax with endless journeys and challenges in a multi-labyrinth game.","description":"Play classic <b> stress-relieving mazes</b> or discover many original ones with <b>square, circular and triangular maze shaped games</b>. Enjoy more than 100 combinations of maze sizes, types, shapes and games modes. #MazeGame\n\nWith beautiful mazes and a simple journey you will know some special maze forms are also available: with bunny, guitar or tree shaped mazes. \n\n<b>Have fun finding the exit through this mesmerizing puzzle experience.</b>\n\nChallenge yourself with a journey through a constellation of mazes to be played in 7 different game modes that include our unique intertwined labyrinths with teleportation portals.\n\nProgress through the constellations and unlock over 100 combinations of maze sizes, types, shapes, and game modes.\n\nKey Features:\n\n-Easy to Play: Swipe to guide the light through the maze and find the exit;\n-Simple and Relaxing: Relax with small mazes or try to solve more advanced ones;\n-Diverse Level Design: Master 4 types of mazes: square, triangular, hexagonal, and circular.\n\nWe have also a few different game modes:\n\n1. Classic Mazes\n2. Time-Limited\n3. Restricted Moves\n4. Token Collection\n5. Intertwined Mazes with Teleportation Portals. \n\nPS: Make sure you find our funny shaped labyrinths\n\nExplore over 5.000 uniquely designed mazes with vivid colors and soothing music\n\nCheck us out at: https://infinitygames.io","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $20.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_w1Ah9Db7b0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/maTUzgoUMjBQSlfBpHTJrig196e3vpUh5Mc7DZw3BpgEy1xmKR43Dk2uRq2eJc3TWAGdlC1Qr5-jZTDfevRZ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w3MYViZCqtr-7lTdLuA5ykl9F-E6MTwP3EtokBAH1LKs-h_BtDk8IgRnpmTRnoi__E_A8szcVcKQM6z11_jq","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aF6eM40nj_nePKsI-9HXtTjsoI4LIaoTap6_jY38ZpSuW